## Version: 3.3.8-WotLK
## SavedVariables: ACP_Data

## Notes: Adds an AddOn manager in game via the 'AddOns' button of the game menu. Special support for multi-part AddOns. Based on rMCP by Rophy.
## Notes-deDE: Fügt über die Schaltfläche 'AddOns' im Spielmenü einen AddOn-Manager hinzu. Besondere Unterstützung für mehrteilige AddOns. Basiert auf rMCP von Rophy.
## Notes-frFR: Ajoute un gestionnaire d'AddOns en jeu via le bouton 'AddOns' du menu de jeu. Prise en charge particulière des AddOns en plusieurs parties. Basé sur rMCP de Rophy.
## Notes-esES: Añade un gestor de AddOns en el juego mediante el botón 'AddOns' del menú de juego. Soporte especial para AddOns de varias partes. Basado en rMCP de Rophy.
## Notes-esMX: Agrega un gestor de AddOns en el juego mediante el botón 'AddOns' del menú de juego. Soporte especial para AddOns de varias partes. Basado en rMCP de Rophy.
## Notes-ptBR: Adiciona um gerenciador de AddOns no jogo pelo botão 'AddOns' do menu do jogo. Suporte especial a AddOns de várias partes. Baseado no rMCP de Rophy.
## Notes-itIT: Aggiunge un gestore di AddOn nel gioco tramite il pulsante 'AddOn' del menu di gioco. Supporto speciale per AddOn in più parti. Basato su rMCP di Rophy.
## Notes-ruRU: Добавляет менеджер аддонов в игре через кнопку 'Аддоны' игрового меню. Особая поддержка аддонов из нескольких частей. Основан на rMCP от Rophy.
## Notes-koKR: 게임 메뉴의 '애드온' 버튼으로 애드온 관리창을 엽니다. 여러 부분으로 나뉘어진 애드온을 특별히 지원합니다. Rophy의 rMCP를 기반으로 합니다.
## Notes-zhCN: 在游戏菜单的“插件”按钮中提供插件管理面板，并特别支持多部分组成的插件。基于 Rophy 的 rMCP。
## Notes-zhTW: 在遊戲選單的「插件」按鈕中提供插件管理面板，並特別支援多部分組成的插件。以 Rophy 的 rMCP 為基礎。

## X-Credits: ACP is based on rMCP, which is MCP modified by Rophy, originally by Saien.
## X-Category: Interface Enhancements
# Languages that ship a complete translation. Any other locale code is still
# accepted by the localization core, but falls back to enUS.
## X-Localizations: enUS, enGB, enCN, deDE, frFR, esES, esMX, ptBR, itIT, ruRU, koKR, zhCN, zhTW

# Localization core. Must stay first: it creates ACP and ACP:RegisterLocale().
ACP-Locale.lua

# One file per language. enUS is the canonical source and the fallback.
# localization-template.lua and ACP-SelfTest.lua are NOT loaded here.
localization-enUS.lua
localization-enGB.lua
localization-enCN.lua
localization-deDE.lua
localization-frFR.lua
localization-esES.lua
localization-esMX.lua
localization-ptBR.lua
localization-itIT.lua
localization-ruRU.lua
localization-koKR.lua
localization-zhCN.lua
localization-zhTW.lua

# Core and interface.
ACP.lua
ACP.xml
